1)In C langugae we can assign any type of data to any type of variable ,internaly compiler will takecare about conversion. This is called implicite typecasting.
2)Type casting is converting one type of data to another type .
3)If compiler will response for that convertion then it is called implicite type casting.
4)If the programmar is responsible for that conversion that  is explicite typecasting 
5)Typecasting is temporary.
6)Each and every assignment operator after assigning right side value to the leftside value it returns assigned  value.

